# Vendor firmware images. Never committed — they are not ours to redistribute.
#
# Tests that use these fixtures skip when the file is absent, so the suite is
# green without them; they simply measure less.
#
# Regenerate a Kepler image from a live die:
#   BAR0 + 0x300000 is the PROM aperture. See
#   infra/wateringHole/experiments/vbios/README.md for the dump procedure.
*.rom
*.bin
